{"unit_id":"dsh-remote__plugin#card-zh","repo":"dsh-remote/plugin","commit":"2003ea7fe5b521341599cd4aef3de6eb5394b2a7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Remote Control 是面向网页和桌面端 DSH 的宿主插件，让用户通过手机远程操作主机。它在 DSH 中接入会话运行时、中继传输，并提供浏览器状态栏组件和设置页入口。用户可查看会话、发送指令、接收流式输出、处理工具审批与问题，还能上传附件并让任务期间的主机保持唤醒。适合需要离开电脑继续跟进 DSH 会话的用户。默认连接官方中继；安装后主机令牌可自动认领，也可自设中继。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:143-170","src/client/main.ts:61-89","src/core/runtime.ts:1-19","src/shell/config.ts:122-146"]}
{"unit_id":"dsh-remote__plugin#card-en","repo":"dsh-remote/plugin","commit":"2003ea7fe5b521341599cd4aef3de6eb5394b2a7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Remote Control lets you use a phone to browse sessions, send prompts, follow live output, approve tools, answer questions, and send files. It links the host to a relay and adds browser status and settings controls. The host can stay awake during work. Use the default relay or your own.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:143-170","src/client/main.ts:61-89","src/core/runtime.ts:1-19","src/shell/config.ts:122-146"]}
